## Slide 3

User Specific Language

Bulk Translations

TrakSYS™
English
Español
Italiano
Italiano
English
Español

This means Operators can view and utilize the software in one language while Supervisors, Administrators, and other high-level users can view and utilize the software in another language, all at the same time.

Via configuration settings on the User in TrakSYS™, or simply using the browser / device language, TrakSYS™ automatically adjusts the language being displayed to best suit the user.

