## Slide 6

Extensible Content

Bulk Translations

Database Driven
Solution specific translations are stored in the database and ready for real-time manipulation rather than being compiled in an immutable DLL.
In-Product UI
TrakSYS™ includes a standard user interface for managing solution specific translations, importing/exporting bulk translations, and replacing temporary placeholders.
Live Updates
Once changes are made to solution specific translations, these updates are immediately visible to users of the system viewing TrakSYS™ in the updated language.
Seamless Use
Solution specific translations can be used in the same way as standard translations. They can be searched for, used within Content Parts such as Headers/Table Column Names, and accessed from Script.

## Slide 7

Point & Click Translations

Bulk Translations

Built-in Pages offer bulk extensible translations using Excel Exports and imports.

Templates provide a framework for translations to be managed and edited as needed.